---
source: crates/cli/tests/code_review_cli.rs
expression: text
---
Review the branch diff and print the verdict report

Usage: toolu code-review run [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --base <REF>        The base to diff against; default: the push-review base
      --json              Print exactly one JSON document on stdout
      --path <PATH>       Review only this path; repeatable. A path-scoped run never writes passing state
  -q, --quiet             Drop the diagnostics of a successful run
      --effort <LEVEL>    Review effort: auto lets Jev pick the level; a fixed level skips it [default: auto] [possible values: auto, small, medium, high, xhigh]
      --host <HOST>       The host to act for, instead of the detected one [possible values: claude, codex, cursor, hermes, muse]
      --config-dir <DIR>  Read the toolu config from DIR instead of the host's default
  -h, --help              Print help
